{"id": "64443", "title": "控制狂（高干）", "author": "顾霓裳", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64443.htm", "intro": "【恶俗版文案】\r\n 棒打鸳鸯？未婚先孕？单身妈妈？呆萌小白？\r\n 单看哪个都够呛，还全部一起来？！\r\n 这不是要命么！\r\n 童左左自认倒霉，乖乖滚去国外躲了六年。\r\n 还以为时间够久没事了，结果刚一回国就又落入那个冰山腹黑控制狂手里……\r\n 情商超低的左左能否逃得出控制狂的手心？\r\n 叶二少冷哼：“想逃？做梦！”\r\n \r\n 【文艺版文案】\r\n 有多少爱可以重来？\r\n 他和她的爱情在六年前爱的痴缠时戛然而止。\r\n 时隔六年，那句我爱你，如今藏在哪里？\r\n 1.本文男主腹黑，前面女主被吃的死死的，后面会翻身。\r\n 2.通篇轻松，中间略带小虐，双处，1V1，HE结局。\r\n 3.女主表面小白，内心不傻。若有雷点，请轻拍。\r\n 4.谢谢好基友翩翩做的封面，超美腻。\r\n 5.谢绝扒榜。\r\n \r\n 【流年】系列第一部→\r\n 裳裳微博，→\r\n 裳裳的专栏，点进去收藏作者，更新早知道→\r\n 裳裳和几个基友写手建的读者群320610868，敲门砖是裳裳的笔名，欢迎乱入来搅基~\r\n #favorite_1{color:#FF3300;font-weight:bold;border-style:double;}", "base": "files/article/html/64/64443", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "9607326.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 01", "file": "9607328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 02", "file": "9607330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 03", "file": "9607332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 04", "file": "9607334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 05", "file": "9607336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 06", "file": "9607337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 07", "file": "9607340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 08", "file": "9607342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 09", "file": "9607344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 10", "file": "9607345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 11", "file": "9607346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 12", "file": "9607347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 13", "file": "9607348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 14", "file": "9607355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 15", "file": "9607357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 16", "file": "9607359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 17", "file": "9607360.html"